                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nMénière's disease can cause severe vertigo in the client. The priority in the nursing care plan would focus on safety issues to prevent falls or injury to the client. Although self-care measures, dietary therapy, and medication therapy may be components of the plan of care, safety is the priority issue.\n",
