                        "content": "The nurse is providing diet instructions to a client with Ménière's disease who is being discharged from the hospital after admission for an acute attack. Which statement, if made by the client, indicates an understanding of the dietary measures to take to help prevent further attacks?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "a0f7d178f7b728b8bba7ef20ddeca62d",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Evaluating 评价",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nDietary changes, such as salt and fluid restrictions, that reduce the amount of endolymphatic fluid are sometimes prescribed for the client with Ménière's disease. The client would be instructed to consume a low-sodium diet and restrict fluids as prescribed. Although helpful to treat other disorders, low-fat, low-carbohydrate, and low-cholesterol diets are not specifically prescribed for the client with Ménière's disease.",
                        "id": "27b43f2908754f058de30dc1a5ffd938",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "01f439004f3f4dc393877a7fd6f16d93",
                                "content": "This procedure involves removing a bone from the ear."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "a7f7f3d426c0476ab4a4d49bf870767f",
                                "content": "This procedure will reduce the pressure you feel in your ear and allow fluid to drain."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "933311cea38a4d00be58e03fd12bc206",
                                "content": "This procedure involves removing the eardrum and inserting a mechanical bone in the ear."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "8f16b2afd08a4ebea5d021c662abb6a7",
                                "content": "This procedure involves removal of the middle ear and insertion of a ring around the ear bones that will vibrate on sound to promote better hearing."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "01f439004f3f4dc393877a7fd6f16d93",
                                    "content": "This procedure involves removing a bone from the ear."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "a7f7f3d426c0476ab4a4d49bf870767f",
                                    "content": "This procedure will reduce the pressure you feel in your ear and allow fluid to drain."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "933311cea38a4d00be58e03fd12bc206",
                                    "content": "This procedure involves removing the eardrum and inserting a mechanical bone in the ear."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
