                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "8f16b2afd08a4ebea5d021c662abb6a7",
                                    "content": "This procedure involves removal of the middle ear and insertion of a ring around the ear bones that will vibrate on sound to promote better hearing."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
